libmirisdr6 (5.1~git20261020-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * libmirisdr-6: RSP1B, RSPdx-R2 and RSPduo support, and a SoapySDR module.
  * Source renamed libmirisdr6, split into libmirisdr5, libmirisdr5-dev,
    miri-sdr6 and soapysdr-module-libmirisdr. The library goes to the
    multiarch directory and the udev rule to /usr/lib/udev/rules.d.
  * libmirisdr5 installs next to Debian's libmirisdr4. libmirisdr5-dev and
    miri-sdr6 take the place of Debian's libmirisdr-dev and miri-sdr, which
    ship the same files.
  * Man pages for miri_sdr, miri_fm and miri_eeprom, and a copyright file.
    miri_test is a development tool and is not packaged.

 -- Bertold Van den Bergh <vandenbergh@bertold.org>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200

